Z||000000||C5Vette||08-12-2001||02:59 PM|||| Hi all, I'm selling my Vette (to many people have them) I want to make a "Super Car" on a Fiero platform.<P> I want it to be a handler first then a 0-60 car.<P>Lets say 1g on the skidpad?<P>0-60 in 4 seconds?<P>1/4 in 13.0?<P>Not asking much am I?<P>What Suspension should I use?<P>What year car should I start with?<P>What engine should I use?<P>I want it to be as light as possible.<P>Maybe a kitcar body? Diablo, 355? maybe something unique?<P>Thanks for the help.<p>[This message has been edited by C5Vette (edited 08-12-2001).]||||reg||1
